=================== BYTE-IDENTITY ===================

Every cell identical on both checks, on both toolchains:
  * `perf stat` cells: an uninstrumented pre-pass wrote port and C .obu from
    the same .yuv and `cmp`'d them — photo_cid p2 46,462 B, photo_cid p6
    45,688 B, screen_terminal p6 10,090 B. Same byte counts the realimg and
